# Project intentions

Read [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md) before expanding scope.

## Stay in v1

Allowed: Druid SQL scan, minute-of-week `FitSeasonalBaseline`, one Kafka message at last+N minutes, env/flag config.

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- Hosting this ticker inside the Grafana plugin
- Helm / container images (sibling `timeseries-k8s`)
- Folding Druid/Kafka I/O into `timeseries-forecast`
- Prometheus
- Prediction intervals
- A forked Series type
- Consuming the metrics Kafka topic

## Optimize computation as you implement

Correctness first, then cost: one O(n) fit per hash per tick, O(1) per horizon step. See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Use the sibling libraries

Input is `timeseries.Series[float64]`. Use the public API only. Depend on tagged `timeseries` and `timeseries-forecast` versions; do not add a `replace` directive.
